# Implementation Plan - Fix OpenGroup (SAST) Scanner Integration

Resolve issues with the OpenGroup SAST scanner integration to ensure findings are produced, deduplicated, enriched with AI and AST reachability, assigned non-zero priority scores, and correctly managed through their lifecycle without breaking existing scanners (Trivy, Gitleaks, Nuclei).

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> A schema migration (Alembic) will add a `fingerprint` column with a unique index to the `findings` table to support upserts and lifecycle tracking (`New` -> `Fixed`).

